WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:10.110
Review checks that objectives, activities, assessment and timing all line up.

2
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:16.689
Each item says what is wrong. Fix it takes you to the right step.

3
00:00:16.689 --> 00:00:23.605
If something is right for your class, press Mark as fine and give a reason.

4
00:00:23.605 --> 00:00:37.659
Choose a layout: the standard school template, or the one-page Consilia Lesson Blueprint.

5
00:00:37.659 --> 00:00:42.174
Print or save as PDF straight from here.

6
00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:49.162
Or download a Word file to edit in Word, Google Docs or WPS.

7
00:00:49.162 --> 00:00:54.775
Links you add get QR codes on the printed lesson plan. Next: watch "Back up and restore".
